SCOPE — READ THIS FIRST

This MIT grant covers the SOFTWARE in this repository only:

    src/mon_language_detector/*.py
    tests/*.py
    Makefile

It does NOT cover the trained model shipped inside the package at

    src/mon_language_detector/data/langid_mon_mya_eng_compressed.ftz

That file is a derived work of a corpus this project neither collected nor owns.
Mon Wikipedia is 54.7% of the raw bytes fed to the Mon class and is CC BY-SA 4.0,
which is copyleft; the Independent Mon News Agency archive is a further 26.6% and
has no established licence at all. An MIT grant over the model would strip a
ShareAlike obligation this project cannot waive and issue a permission it does
not hold.

For the model, see LICENSE-MODEL.md. It states the sources, which of their terms
are established, and which are not.

